<title>USA: American Oilfield buys Tidewater vessel.</title>
<headline>American Oilfield buys Tidewater vessel.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Oilfield Divers Inc said it has bought M/V OSA DEFENDER, a diving support vessel from Tidewater Inc for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>The vessel will support American's deepwater subsea services in the Gulf of Mexico, the company said.</p>
<p>The vessel should be ready for service during the fourth quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsroom 212 859 1902))</p>
